  "$comment": "Poimandres. Source: https://github.com/drcmda/poimandres-theme. Licence: MIT. No orange and no purple: pink2 and blue stand in. accent = teal, link = blue2 #add7ff, red = pink #d0679d (the theme's error colour). Light block derived from the dark values (no upstream light variant): OKLCH, canvas hue kept, hues darkened in lightness for text on canvas (accent #057d6a, link/info #4c7296, success #227c6c, warning #af4c82, danger #b04a81).",
